            "line": 81,
            "text": "def UniformFiniteEnergy (times : Set ℝ) (u : VelocityField) : Prop :=\n  ∃ E : ℝ, 0 ≤ E ∧ ∀ t ∈ times,\n    SquareIntegrableAtTime u t ∧ kineticEnergy u t ≤ E"
